  "description": "A one-shot jump: crouch, launch, airtime, land. Launch and Land are instant notifies; Airborne is a notify state (begin, tick every 0.1 s, end) covering the time off the ground; JumpHeight is a float curve a graph can read. It does not loop, so play it with looping set to once."
